with rice, cucumber and broth.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"np_momo","c":"Nepal","cat":"Hamur İşi","d":"Orta","p":45,"k":20,"sv":4,"tr":"Nepal Momo","en":"Nepali Momo","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Momo_nepal.jpg/500px-Momo_nepal.jpg","ing":[{"k":"un","n":"Un","ne":"Flour","a":"2","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"kiyma","n":"Kıyma (tavuk veya dana)","ne":"Ground Chicken or Beef","a":"300","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"sogan","n":"Soğan","ne":"Onion","a":"1","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"sarimsak","n":"Sarımsak ve Zencefil","ne":"Garlic and Ginger","a":"1","u":"yemek kaşığı","ue":"tbsp"},{"k":"kisnis","n":"Kişniş","ne":"Cilantro","a":"1","u":"demet","ue":"bunch"},{"k":"baharat","n":"Kimyon ve Karabiber","ne":"Cumin and Pepper","a":"1","u":"çay kaşığı","ue":"tsp"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"bowl","sec":1200,"t":"Hamur","i":"Un, bir tutam tuz ve ılık suyla sert bir hamur yoğurup 20 dakika dinlendirin.","te":"Dough","ie":"Knead flour, a pinch of salt and warm water into a firm dough and rest 20 minutes.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":2,"tool":"bowl","sec":300,"t":"İç Harç","i":"Kıyma, ince doğranmış soğan, sarımsak, zencefil, kişniş ve baharatları karıştırın.","te":"Filling","ie":"Mix meat, finely chopped onion, garlic, ginger, cilantro and spices.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":3,"tool":"plate","sec":900,"t":"Şekillendirme","i":"Hamuru ince açıp 8 cm daireler kesin, ortasına 1 yemek kaşığı harç koyun ve kenarları kıvırarak kapatın.","te":"Shape","ie":"Roll thin, cut 8 cm circles, add 1 tbsp filling and pleat the edges closed.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":4,"tool":"pot","sec":720,"t":"Buharda Pişirme","i":"Yağlanmış buharlı pişiricide 10-12 dakika pişirin; acı domates sosuyla servis edin.","te":"Steam","ie":"Steam in an oiled steamer 10-12 minutes and serve with spicy tomato chutney.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"pk_karahi","c":"Pakistan","cat":"Ana Yemek","d":"Orta","p":15,"k":35,"sv":4,"tr":"Tavuk Karahi","en":"Chicken Karahi","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Wok-and-karahi-2.jpg/500px-Wok-and-karahi-2.jpg","ing":[{"k":"tavuk","n":"Bütün Tavuk (parçalanmış)","ne":"Chicken, cut in pieces","a":"1","u":"kg","ue":"kg"},{"k":"domates","n":"Domates","ne":"Tomatoes","a":"4","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"yogurt","n":"Yoğurt","ne":"Yogurt","a":"0.25","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"sarimsak","n":"Sarımsak ve Zencefil","ne":"Garlic and Ginger","a":"2","u":"yemek kaşığı","ue":"tbsp"},{"k":"biber","n":"Yeşil Biber","ne":"Green Chilies","a":"3","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"baharat","n":"Kimyon, Kişniş, Karabiber","ne":"Cumin, Coriander, Pepper","a":"2","u":"çay kaşığı","ue":"tsp"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"pan","sec":420,"t":"Tavuğu Mühürleme","i":"Geniş tavada yağı ısıtın, sarımsak-zencefili ve tavuğu 7 dakika renk alana kadar kavurun.","te":"Sear","ie":"Heat oil in a wide pan and brown chicken with garlic and ginger for 7 minutes.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":2,"tool":"pan","sec":900,"t":"Domates","i":"Doğranmış domatesi, baharatı ve tuzu ekleyin; kapağı kapatıp domates dağılana ve yağ yüzeye çıkana kadar 15 dakika pişirin.","te":"Tomatoes","ie":"Add chopped tomatoes, spices and salt; cover and cook 15 minutes until the tomatoes collapse and oil separates.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":3,"tool":"pan","sec":300,"t":"Yoğurt ve Bitirme","i":"Yoğurdu ekleyip sosu koyulaştırın, yeşil biber ve zencefil julyenle bitirin.","te":"Finish","ie":"Stir in yogurt, thicken the sauce and finish with green chilies and ginger julienne.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"it_carbonara","c":"İtalya","cat":"Ana Yemek","d":"Orta","p":10,"k":15,"sv":2,"tr":"Spaghetti alla Carbonara","en":"Spaghetti alla Carbonara","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Espaguetis_carbonara.jpg/500px-Espaguetis_carbonara.jpg","ing":[{"k":"makarna","n":"Spagetti","ne":"Spaghetti","a":"200","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"et","n":"Guanciale veya Pancetta","ne":"Guanciale or Pancetta","a":"100","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"yumurta","n":"Yumurta Sarısı","ne":"Egg Yolks","a":"3","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"peynir","n":"Pecorino Romano (rendelenmiş)","ne":"Grated Pecorino Romano","a":"60","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"biberSiyah","n":"Karabiber","ne":"Black Pepper","a":"1","u":"çay kaşığı","ue":"tsp"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"pot","sec":600,"t":"Makarna","i":"Bol tuzlu suda spagettiyi al dente haşlayın; 1 kepçe makarna suyunu ayırın.","te":"Boil Pasta","ie":"Cook spaghetti al dente in well-salted water; reserve a ladle of pasta water.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":2,"tool":"pan","sec":360,"t":"Et","i":"Küp doğranmış guancialeyi soğuk tavada kısık ateşte yağı çıkıp çıtırlaşana kadar kızartın.","te":"Render the Pork","ie":"Cook diced guanciale in a cold pan over low heat until the fat renders and it turns crisp.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":3,"tool":"bowl","sec":60,"t":"Krema","i":"Sarılar, peynir ve bol karabiberi bir kapta macun kıvamına getirin. Krema eklenmez.","te":"Egg Cream","ie":"Beat yolks, cheese and plenty of pepper into a paste. No cream is used.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":4,"tool":"pan","sec":90,"t":"Birleştirme","i":"Makarnayı tavaya alın, ocağı KAPATIN, sarı karışımını ve biraz makarna suyunu ekleyip hızlıca karıştırın.","te":"Combine","ie":"Add pasta to the pan, turn the heat OFF, stir in the egg mixture with a splash of pasta water until creamy.","p":"Tava çok sıcaksa yumurta omlet olur; ateşten alın.","pe":"If the pan is too hot the eggs scramble; take it off the heat."}]},{"cov":"","id":"fr_crepes","c":"Fransa","cat":"Kahvaltılık","d":"Çok Kolay","p":10,"k":15,"sv":4,"tr":"Fransız Krepi (Crêpes)","en":"French Crêpes","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Crepes_dsc07085.jpg/500px-Crepes_dsc07085.jpg","ing":[{"k":"un","n":"Un","ne":"Flour","a":"1","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"yumurta","n":"Yumurta","ne":"Eggs","a":"2","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"sut","n":"Süt","ne":"Milk","a":"1.5","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"tereyagi","n":"Eritilmiş Tereyağı","ne":"Melted Butter","a":"2","u":"yemek kaşığı","ue":"tbsp"},{"k":"tuz","n":"Tuz","ne":"Salt","a":"1","u":"tutam","ue":"pinch"},{"k":"seker","n":"Şeker","ne":"Sugar","a":"1","u":"yemek kaşığı","ue":"tbsp"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"whisk","sec":300,"t":"Hamur","i":"Un, yumurta, süt, tereyağı, tuz ve şekeri topaksız, akışkan bir hamur olana kadar çırpın. 30 dakika dinlendirin.","te":"Batter","ie":"Whisk flour, eggs, milk, butter, salt and sugar into a smooth, thin batter; rest 30 minutes.","p":"Dinlenen hamur daha yumuşak krep verir.","pe":"Resting gives softer crêpes."},{"o":2,"tool":"pan","sec":120,"t":"Pişirme","i":"Hafif yağlı tavayı ısıtın, bir kepçe hamuru döküp tavayı çevirerek inceltin; 1 dakika sonra çevirin.","te":"Cook","ie":"Heat a lightly oiled pan, pour a ladle of batter, swirl thin; flip after 1 minute.","p":"İlk krep genelde deneme olur, olsun.","pe":"The first crêpe is usually a test."},{"o":3,"tool":"plate","sec":60,"t":"Servis","i":"Limon-şeker, çikolata veya reçelle katlayıp servis edin.","te":"Serve","ie":"Fold and serve with lemon-sugar, chocolate or jam.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"es_tortilla","c":"İspanya","cat":"Kahvaltılık","d":"Orta","p":15,"k":25,"sv":4,"tr":"İspanyol Tortillası (Tortilla Española)","en":"Tortilla Española","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Tortilla_de_patata_-_San_Sebasti%C3%A1n.jpg/500px-Tortilla_de_patata_-_San_Sebasti%C3%A1n.jpg","ing":[{"k":"patates","n":"Patates","ne":"Potatoes","a":"500","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"sogan","n":"Soğan","ne":"Onion","a":"1","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"yumurta","n":"Yumurta","ne":"Eggs","a":"6","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"zeytinyagi","n":"Zeytinyağı","ne":"Olive Oil","a":"0.5","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"tuz","n":"Tuz","ne":"Salt","a":"1","u":"çay kaşığı","ue":"tsp"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"knife","sec":300,"t":"Doğrama","i":"Patatesi ince dilimleyin, soğanı ince doğrayın.","te":"Slice","ie":"Thinly slice the potatoes and dice the onion.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":2,"tool":"pan","sec":1200,"t":"Yağda Pişirme","i":"Patates ve soğanı bol zeytinyağında kısık ateşte yumuşayana (20 dk) pişirin, kızartmadan; süzün.","te":"Poach in Oil","ie":"Gently cook potatoes and onion in plenty of olive oil over low heat for 20 minutes until tender, not crisp; drain.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":3,"tool":"bowl","sec":120,"t":"Yumurta","i":"Yumurtaları çırpıp patatesle karıştırın ve 5 dakika dinlendirin.","te":"Egg Mix","ie":"Beat the eggs, fold in the potatoes and rest 5 minutes.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":4,"tool":"pan","sec":480,"t":"Çevirme","i":"Tavada 4 dakika pişirin, büyük bir tabakla ters çevirip diğer yüzünü 3 dakika pişirin; içi hafif sulu kalsın.","te":"Flip","ie":"Cook 4 minutes, flip using a large plate and cook another 3 minutes; the centre should stay slightly soft.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"gr_spanakopita","c":"Yunanistan","cat":"Hamur İşi","d":"Orta","p":30,"k":45,"sv":6,"tr":"Ispanaklı Börek (Σπανακόπιτα)","en":"Spanakopita (Σπανακόπιτα)","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Spanakopita.jpg/500px-Spanakopita.jpg","ing":[{"k":"yufka","n":"Yufka","ne":"Phyllo Sheets","a":"10","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"ispanak","n":"Ispanak","ne":"Spinach","a":"600","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"peynir","n":"Beyaz Peynir (feta)","ne":"Feta Cheese","a":"250","u":"g","ue":"g"},{"k":"yumurta","n":"Yumurta","ne":"Eggs","a":"2","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"sogan","n":"Taze Soğan","ne":"Green Onions","a":"4","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"zeytinyagi","n":"Zeytinyağı","ne":"Olive Oil","a":"0.5","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"knife","sec":420,"t":"İç","i":"Ispanağı ve soğanı doğrayıp tuzla ovun, suyunu iyice sıkın. Peynir, yumurta ve otlarla karıştırın.","te":"Filling","ie":"Chop spinach and onions, salt, and squeeze out all the water. Mix with feta, eggs and herbs.","p":"Suyunu sıkmak böreğin ıslak kalmaması için şart.","pe":"Squeezing out water prevents a soggy pie."},{"o":2,"tool":"bowl","sec":600,"t":"Kat Kat Dizme","i":"Tepsiyi yağlayıp 5 yufkayı her birini zeytinyağıyla fırçalayarak dizin, iç harcı yayın, kalan yufkalarla kapatın.","te":"Layer","ie":"Oil the tray, stack 5 sheets brushing each with olive oil, spread filling and top with the remaining sheets.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":3,"tool":"oven","sec":2700,"t":"Fırın","i":"Üstünü zeytinyağıyla fırçalayıp dilimleyin, 180°C fırında 40-45 dakika altın rengi olana kadar pişirin.","te":"Bake","ie":"Brush the top, score portions and bake at 180°C for 40-45 minutes until golden.","p":"","pe":""}]},{"cov":"","id":"de_schnitzel","c":"Almanya","cat":"Ana Yemek","d":"Orta","p":20,"k":15,"sv":2,"tr":"Wiener Schnitzel (Almanya/Avusturya usulü)","en":"Schnitzel","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Breitenlesau_Krug_Br%C3%A4u_Schnitzel.JPG/500px-Breitenlesau_Krug_Br%C3%A4u_Schnitzel.JPG","ing":[{"k":"et","n":"Dana veya Domuz Eti Dilimi","ne":"Veal or Pork Cutlet","a":"2","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"un","n":"Un","ne":"Flour","a":"0.5","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"yumurta","n":"Yumurta","ne":"Eggs","a":"2","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"},{"k":"galeta","n":"Galeta Unu","ne":"Breadcrumbs","a":"1","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"tereyagi","n":"Tereyağı veya Sıvı Yağ","ne":"Butter or Oil","a":"0.5","u":"su bardağı","ue":"cup"},{"k":"limon","n":"Limon","ne":"Lemon","a":"1","u":"adet","ue":"pcs"}],"st":[{"o":1,"tool":"hammer","sec":180,"t":"İnceltme","i":"Etleri streç arasında 5 mm kalınlığa kadar tokmaklayın, tuz-biberleyin.","te":"Pound Thin","ie":"Pound the cutlets between plastic wrap to 5 mm thick and season.","p":"","pe":""},{"o":2,"tool":"bowl","sec":180,"t":"Panelemek","i":"Sırayla una, çırpılmış yumurtaya ve galeta ununa bulayın; galetayı bastırmayın.","te":"Bread","ie":"Dredge in flour, then egg, then breadcrumbs; do not press the crumbs on.","p":"Bastırmazsanız kızarırken kabarır ve ayrı bir kabuk oluşur.","pe":"Not pressing lets the crust puff and separate slightly."},{"o":3,"tool":"pan","sec":360,"t":"Kızartma","i":"Bol yağda orta-yü